   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 13. Optional CH3 output test\n",
    "\n",
    "CH3 has no documented remote output-state query, so this test requires physical observation and always sends `OFF` in `finally`.\n",
